/* Glovebox CarPlay user-facing strings.
 *
 * Keys mirror those used in NSLocalizedString call-sites in the iOS Swift
 * source. The `value:` parameter on each call-site is the canonical English
 * source string; this file provides the explicit English copy. Future
 * translations land as siblings (e.g. fr.lproj/Localizable.strings).
 *
 * Compliance note: Apple's CarPlay HIG asks for NSLocalizedString-wrapped
 * strings on user-visible CarPlay surfaces even for English-only apps so
 * non-English vehicle systems can render correctly when CarPlay is set to a
 * different locale than the phone.
 */

